      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARLI MOO (1) generally breaks well and with clear running can clear the draw. Latest effort finished 2nd on September 10 over 730m at Angle Park behind Zipping Bilpin beaten 4.5 lengths (43.44) in a Grade 6. Looks suited and should go close. NOVA'S FERN (3) had been racing well prior to her last start fifth at Mt Gambier following a Grade 5/6 win three back with a third placing. Has good early burn and drawn to be prominent early off a low draw. Well placed here and can atone this time. AKELA MARTIAL (5) comes here off a placing in handy time (35.28) over 600m at Mt Gambier. In form and looks a leading player again. NITRO NEO (7) must be included in calculations.",
